{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G1-01","example":{"sceneId":"g1-01","issue":{"title":"先看現況：人車空間與提示是否清楚？","intro":"主要道路約 28 m、次要道路約 14 m，周邊為住宅與商業區。","images":[{"key":"g101-before","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":90},{"key":"results:g1-01-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-01-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-01-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-01-photo-4","label":"現況照片 4","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-01-photo-5","label":"現況照片 5","role":"photo","rotation":0,"crop":[36.115,301.544,2167.705,1455.315]}],"items":[{"id":"priority","title":"路權與速限提示不足","text":"缺少清楚的主次道路管制，兩條道路的速限提示也不完整。"},{"id":"space","title":"路側空間混用","text":"慢車道同時承擔停車與公車停靠，行車邊界需要整理。"},{"id":"turn","title":"左轉影響直行續進","text":"直行與左轉共用車道，需檢視轉向等待空間。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"strategy":{"title":"把行車、穿越與停放空間分清楚","intro":"用一張完整佈設圖，對照本情境的四項改善重點。","images":[{"key":"overall","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":90}],"items":[{"id":"edge","title":"界定行車與路側空間","text":"以路面邊線、停放線整理邊界與停車範圍。","articleId":"edge","moduleId":"M1-03"},{"id":"pedestrian","title":"看見行人穿越需求","text":"配置行穿線，搭配當心行人等必要提示。","articleId":"crosswalk","moduleId":"M3-01"},{"id":"path","title":"引導直行與轉彎動線","text":"以指向線、導引線與穿越虛線，銜接左彎附加車道。","articleId":"taper","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"environment","title":"傳達速限與學校環境","text":"檢視速限與學校標誌，讓道路環境資訊更清楚。","articleId":"speed","moduleId":"M4-01"}]},"sourceSlides":[38,39]},"assets":{"g101-before":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-01/G1-01_現況圖_01.png","width":1967,"height":2454,"label":"G1-01 現況圖","scenario":"G1-01","role":"diagram","rotation":90,"sourceSlide":38,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image21.png","sha256":"ae72a6bf68b473fbf0c6d5d930605972a9702d4d6d9d2d26fc6249d2ca1007db"},"results:g1-01-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-01/G1-01_現況照片_01.png","width":2583,"height":1048,"label":"G1-01 現況照片","scenario":"G1-01","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourc